[[File:map015.png|center|350px]]
'''Spacetime Distortion''' (時空のゆがみ, ''Jikū no Yugami'', '''Space-time Distortion''') is the 38th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]] and the 87th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. The first five stages are copies of [[Stories of Legend]]'s [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] "boss" stages with added [[Aku Doge]]s and increased magnifications on other support enemies.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is a breath of fresh air compared to the previous ones, as most stages are relatively easy because players will have amassed quite a bit of experience on stages largely identical to the first five, while the sixth has low magnifications for this part of the game. The only stage that may be a challenge is the third stage, [[Learned to Hate]], where most of the enemies have even higher buffs than in {{3c}} [[Learned to Love]], which could make it difficult to rush with underleveled cats.
{{LegendDiff|130|150|100}}

==New Features==
The [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait is introduced here. Aku enemies often have [[Shield]]s, which function similarly to [[Barrier]]s, but take cumulative damage rather than needing a single hit to break, regenerate after each damage-based knockback, and scale with strength magnification. [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breakers]] and the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] will not work against Shields; instead, [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] can destroy them instantly.

This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Aku Doge]]: An Aku variant of [[Doge]]. At the 600% strength magnification he's given in [[Uncanny Legends]], he deals 13,200 damage with [[Single Attack]], and he has a 27,000 HP Shield that regenerates with 50% HP for each damage-based knockback.

